# Fast gate. Everything here is paid on every commit, so it is deliberately
# short — the unit suites are in pre-push, and the reason is in that file.

# Prettier over the *staged* files only, re-staging what it rewrites, so what
# lands is already formatted. `--ignore-unknown` is what lets the pattern be a
# bare `*` in .lintstagedrc: .sql migrations, schema.prisma and the .png
# fixtures pass straight through instead of erroring for want of a parser.
bunx lint-staged

# The cheapest real feedback in the repo: four workspaces, ~17s, and it is the
# check that catches the class of mistake nothing else here would.
bun run typecheck
